    {
     "t": "text",
     "html": "<p><img data-ref=\"https://www.thehighway90.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/website-banner-mobile-sizing-2024-12-30T134913.334.png\" alt=\"Download the highway 90 app today and get 100 bonus loyalty points!\"></p><p>Great news, Highway 90 fans! We’re excited to announce the launch of our brand-new app, designed to make your experience with us even more rewarding. Download the Highway 90 app today and start enjoying all the fantastic features right at your fingertips. Plus, to get you started, we’re giving away 100 bonus loyalty points just for downloading!</p><h3><strong>What Can You Do with the Highway 90 App?</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Track Your Loyalty Points:</strong> Keep an eye on your loyalty points balance and watch them grow with every purchase. It’s the easiest way to earn rewards and save on future visits.</li><li><strong>View Your Purchase History:</strong> Need to check what you’ve bought? The app gives you access to your complete purchase history, so you can see everything you’ve enjoyed in the past.</li><li><strong>Purchase Digital Gift Cards</strong>: Need the perfect gift for a friend or family member? Buy digital gift cards directly from the app! Plus, they can be purchased with credit or debit cards. </li><li><strong>Become a VIP:</strong> Unlock exclusive VIP perks and enjoy special offers, discounts, and more when you become a part of our loyal customer family. VIP members receive 100 bonus points every month, a 25% off coupon every month, a 10% off coupon every month, AND earn 1.5 points per dollar spent. Subscribe now for $12 a month or $100 a year.</li><li><strong>Refer a Friend:</strong> Invite your friends to join the Highway 90 family and earn rewards for both of you! Send your unique code to your friend, and when they join through your link and make a purchase, they’ll get 50 bonus loyalty points and you’ll get a FREE <a href=\"/brands/anthologie/\">Anthologie Pre-Roll</a> for referring them!* While supplies last. </li><li><strong>Shop the Menu:</strong> Browse our full menu from the comfort of your home and place orders for pickup straight from the app.</li></ul><h3><strong>Don’t Miss Out – Download Now!</strong></h3><p>It’s the perfect time to download the Highway 90 app—grab your 100 bonus loyalty points when you sign up, and start enjoying all the perks today! Whether you’re browsing our menu, earning rewards, or buying gift cards for friends, the Highway 90 app is your new best friend.</p><p>Download today and make every visit to Highway 90 even better! Available now in the <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/highway-90/id6736954927\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Apple App store</a> and <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.springbig.highway90\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Play. </a></p><p><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/highway-90/id6736954927\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img data-ref=\"https://www.thehighway90.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Download-on-the-Apple-App-Store.png\" alt=\"Download now on the apple app store\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.springbig.highway90\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img data-ref=\"https://www.thehighway90.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Download-on-Google-Play.png\" alt=\"Download now on google play\"></a></p>",
